# Implementation Order

When starting a feature, follow:
1. Read product/domain requirements.
2. Read data model.
3. Read API contract.
4. Update OpenAPI if the contract changes.
5. Implement migration/model changes.
6. Implement domain/use case.
7. Implement DTO/request/resource.
8. Implement controller/route.
9. Add events/jobs where required.
10. Add automated tests.

Do not skip directly from a UI request to controller code when the domain contract is undefined.
